- 8c455f28 gauntlet: blend E[log W]-per-CPU family rank into allocate_by_yield
  (idea 617; SEAL_CLEARS row on LIVE)
Each diff is applied unchanged (merge-base..tip); no line edited. One head means one
SEAL CLEAR, one carrier and one sign instead of four that conflict on the same file.

